# Dockerfile.server builds from moe_profiler, moe_pruner, scripts/prune.py and the
# lockfile alone, so the build context is an allowlist: everything else in the
# repo (onpolicy_env, .venv, runs, VM images) stays out, whatever gets added later.
*
!moe_profiler/
!moe_pruner/
!scripts/prune.py
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
